Oh, they see us.

529
00:22:12,665 --> 00:22:14,083
Oh, they look mad.

530
00:22:15,793 --> 00:22:17,211
Oh, they figured it out.

531
00:22:17,253 --> 00:22:18,504
They're coming
this way. Run.

532
00:22:18,545 --> 00:22:19,588
Where?
Mexico!

533
00:22:26,386 --> 00:22:28,597
Can you believe
they're still not here?

534
00:22:28,639 --> 00:22:29,974
I know.

535
00:22:30,016 --> 00:22:32,643
A double blind date
and we both get stood up.

536
00:22:32,685 --> 00:22:34,061
What are the chances?

537
00:22:34,103 --> 00:22:37,397
I know. I'm so bummed.

538
00:22:37,439 --> 00:22:40,109
Could we have our
free crab cakes now?

539
00:22:41,319 --> 00:22:42,611
What?

540
00:22:42,653 --> 00:22:44,613
We've been stood up,

541
00:22:44,655 --> 00:22:47,783
and we want
our free crab cakes.

542
00:22:47,825 --> 00:22:49,451
Guys, give it a rest.

543
00:22:49,493 --> 00:22:51,120
Nobody's betting
on you tonight.

544
00:22:51,162 --> 00:22:52,872
Although we do have
a pool going

545
00:22:52,913 --> 00:22:55,166
to see how long it takes
that guy to cry.

546
00:22:57,084 --> 00:22:59,086
I have such fat hands!

547
00:22:59,128 --> 00:23:02,380
